 "remarks": "Welcome home to this desirable, sunlit end-unit townhouse in the heart of Glenbrook! Loving maintained, this multi-level condo features an open floor plan with hardwood floors, 9 ft+ ceilings, and a cozy gas-log fireplace in the living area. The eat-in kitchen and open dining area lead seamlessly through sliders to a private outdoor deck, perfect for entertaining. Upstairs, enjoy an expansive Primary Suite complete with a whirlpool jetted tub, stall shower, and walk-in closet. Two additional spacious bedrooms and a dedicated upper-level laundry room add everyday convenience. Modern comforts include gas heat, central air, and an attached two-car garage. Conveniently located within walking distance to the Glenbrook train station, local shops, restaurants, parks, and commuting routes.",
